ing position.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/focusedObject(_:)-1jq39":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"focusedObject(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"focusedObject"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/focusedObject(_:)-1jq39","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/focusedobject(_:)-1jq39","type":"topic","role":"symbol"}}}